Package: novaos-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: NovaOS Project <novaos@localhost>
Depends: calamares, rsync, cryptsetup, pkexec, live-config, squashfs-tools, dosfstools, efibootmgr, os-prober
Description: NovaOS graphical installer (Calamares configuration)
 Calamares configuration and branding of NovaOS: language, keyboard, time
 zone, disk selection (erase / alongside / manual, optional LUKS encryption),
 user account, progress slideshow. Installs a Secure Boot capable GRUB
 (Debian's signed shim) on UEFI machines and grub-pc on BIOS machines.
 .
 This package is only needed on the live medium; the installer removes it
 from the installed system.
